393	     * records each part in the audit. The amounts have already been checked to be more than zero; they
394	     * must add up exactly to the payment, and each must go to a different sent invoice of the client
395	     * and be no more than what it still has due. The date must be no later than today nor before any
396	     * of the invoices' issue dates. The reference (null when none) has already been checked; it must
397	     * be the reference of one of the invoices.
398	     */
399	    @Transactional
